### 3\. But there is one technical limitation

GPT4All's normal chat interface does not automatically execute Python code or SQL queries generated by the model.

We need a connection between its chat interface and our Python backend.

There are two possible approaches:

| Approach                   | How it works                                  |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| GPT4All Local API          | Python communicates with GPT4All's local API  |
| Custom GPT4All integration | Connect a database tool to the chat interface |

The first approach is easier to experiment with, but it does not automatically make GPT4All's desktop chat use the Python backend.

